WEBVTT

NOTE Provenance: First 40s clip transcribed in Translator then translated in Translator (English 30s overlay). Not YouTube automatic captions. 13 cues / first 30s only.

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:03.318
Yes, on Lee Dong-jin's Pyiyakiha, we have a truly special guest with us today.

00:00:03.318 --> 00:00:06.500
Director Lee Jung-jae is here with us.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.057
Hello.

00:00:08.057 --> 00:00:10.739
So, there are now only two weeks left until the release.

00:00:10.739 --> 00:00:11.637
Yes, that's right.

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:16.678
If I try to imagine how it is for you as the director right now, how should I put it?

00:00:16.678 --> 00:00:18.879
On the one hand, you must be feeling good, but on the other hand, a bit…

00:00:18.879 --> 00:00:19.318
Like your blood is drying up.

00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:20.879
Nervous as well—how do you feel?

00:00:20.879 --> 00:00:21.818
How are you feeling these days?

00:00:21.818 --> 00:00:28.079
I thought I would be really nervous at the press screening, but I actually wasn't trembling that badly.

00:00:28.079 --> 00:00:28.777
Yes, yes.

00:00:28.777 --> 00:00:30.000
Since they are all film people as well, I ended up thinking, "Ah, I've just done my best here."
